                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>.</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11'>The top-performing campaigns generated significantly higher revenue and profit than the remaining campaigns. </run>
