                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>.</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11'>Campaign efficiency varies considerably, indicating that budget allocation can be optimized by investing more in successful campaigns. </run>
