                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>.</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11'>Customer segments contribute differently to revenue, profit, and conversions, emphasizing the importance of audience segmentation. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>.</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11'>Some segments achieve stronger ROI, making them ideal targets for future marketing campaigns. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>.</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11'>Revenue distribution across customer segments suggests that no single segment dominates overall performance. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>.</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11'>Marketing strategies should be tailored to each customer segment to maximize profitability and conversion rates.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
