            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11'>Marketing campaigns generated </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11'>strong overall revenue and profit</run>
