            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11'>Revenue remained relatively stable throughout the analysis period, with a slight decline toward the most recent months. </run>
