            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11'>The selected filters (Date, Region, Channel, and Segment) reveal that campaign performance varies across different marketing dimensions. </run>
