            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11'>High-performing regions present opportunities for increased investment, while lower-performing regions may require campaign optimization.</run>
